          List.mem_dedup.mpr ( List.mem_mergeSort.mpr ( by aesop ) ),
          List.mem_dedup.mpr ( List.mem_mergeSort.mpr ( by aesop ) ) ⟩ ) ( h_dedup_sorted h_sorted )
